---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
import ProjectPage from '../../components/ProjectPage.astro'
import TextScene from '../../components/TextScene.astro'
---

<Layout>
  <ProjectPage title="Text Scene">
    <TextScene slot="project-code" />

    <Fragment slot="project-description">
      <p>
        First experimentation with the TextGeometry. The scene is very similar
        to the one we build during the lesson 13 "3d text".
      </p>
      <p>
        I made very simple entry animations with GSAP, and used
        MeshNormalMaterial on the text and the BoxGeometries around it. I think
        I'll come back to text experimentations later, when I'll have studied
        more advanced techniques, and maybe get inspiration from some inspiring
        Codrops tutorials.
      </p>
    </Fragment>
  </ProjectPage>
</Layout>
